{{also|Fragen}}
==German==

===Etymology===
From {{etyl|gmh|de}} {{term|vragen|vrāgen|lang=gmh}}, from {{etyl|goh|de}} {{term|fragen|frāgēn|lang=goh}}, {{term|frahen|frahēn/frāhēn|lang=goh}}, which is indirectly derived from {{etyl|gem-pro|de}} {{recons|fregnaną|lang=gem-pro}}, from {{etyl|ine-pro|de}} {{recons|preḱ-||to ask|lang=ine-pro}}.<ref>{{R:EWddS|ed=22|hw=Frage, fragen}}</ref>

===Pronunciation===
* {{audio|De-fragen.ogg|audio}}
* {{rhymes|aːgn̩|lang=de}}
* {{hyphenation|fra|gen}}
{{rfp|lang=de}}

===Verb===
{{de-verb-strong|class=6|[[fragt]]''' ''or'' '''[[frägt]]|[[fragte]]''' ''or archaic'' '''[[frug]]|gefragt}}

# to [[ask]]

====Conjugation====
The strong verb {{term|fragen}} has recently weakened, such that the historical past form {{term|frug}} has been replaced by {{term|fragte}} in most dialects.

